 "subs": [
  {
   "s": 1.0,
   "e": 3.484,
   "text": "Top three true crime cases\ntied to stories of demons.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 3.934,
   "e": 5.429,
   "text": "Number three: Son of Sam.",
   "hl": [
    "Son of Sam"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 5.879,
   "e": 7.872,
   "text": "After shooting six people\nto death in New York,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 8.122,
   "e": 9.71,
   "text": "David Berkowitz\nclaimed the one giving",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 9.83,
   "e": 11.626,
   "text": "him orders was his\nneighbor's black dog.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 12.076,
   "e": 14.626,
   "text": "He said a 6,000-year-old\ndemon had possessed the dog",
   "hl": [
    "6,000-year-old"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 14.876,
   "e": 16.671,
   "text": "and used its voice\nto order him to kill.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 17.121,
   "e": 18.747,
   "text": "Two years later,\nin a prison interview,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 18.997,
   "e": 20.369,
   "text": "Berkowitz admitted\nhe had made up",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 20.489,
   "e": 21.893,
   "text": "the demon to\nexcuse his crimes.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 22.343,
   "e": 24.166,
   "text": "It was not until\n1987 that he turned",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 24.286,
   "e": 25.913,
   "text": "to God to beg\nfor forgiveness.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 26.363,
   "e": 28.056,
   "text": "Number two: the\nAmityville house.",
   "hl": [
    "Amityville"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 28.506,
   "e": 30.429,
   "text": "One evening in\nNovember 1974,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 30.679,
   "e": 32.171,
   "text": "Ronald DeFeo Jr.\nran into a bar,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 32.291,
   "e": 33.952,
   "text": "saying his parents\nhad been shot.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 34.402,
   "e": 36.76,
   "text": "Only when friends followed\nhim home did they discover",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 37.01,
   "e": 38.546,
   "text": "that all four of\nhis younger siblings",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 38.666,
   "e": 40.147,
   "text": "were also dead in\ntheir bedrooms.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 40.597,
   "e": 41.108,
   "text": "The next day,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 41.228,
   "e": 43.934,
   "text": "Ronald confessed that he was\nthe one who had fired the gun.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 44.384,
   "e": 45.762,
   "text": "In court, he said\nvoices had urged",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 45.882,
   "e": 47.166,
   "text": "him to kill his\nwhole family.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 47.616,
   "e": 50.028,
   "text": "A year later, the Lutz\nfamily moved into that house.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 50.478,
   "e": 52.721,
   "text": "Mr. Lutz said that when a\npriest came to bless it,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 52.971,
   "e": 54.801,
   "text": "the priest heard a\nvoice shout: \"Get out!\"",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 55.251,
   "e": 57.433,
   "text": "The Lutz family lasted\nonly 28 days there.",
   "hl": [
    "28 days"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 57.883,
   "e": 60.175,
   "text": "Number one: the case behind\nthe movie Emily Rose.",
   "hl": [
    "Emily Rose"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 60.625,
   "e": 62.583,
   "text": "Two years after\nAnneliese Michel died,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 62.833,
   "e": 64.064,
   "text": "her sister heard\nher voice again,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 64.184,
   "e": 65.376,
   "text": "in the middle\nof a courtroom.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 65.826,
   "e": 68.505,
   "text": "The court was playing a tape\nrecorded during an exorcism.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 68.955,
   "e": 70.833,
   "text": "On the tape, two\npriests recite prayers,",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 71.083,
   "e": 72.587,
   "text": "while Anneliese\nscreams back in a",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 72.707,
   "e": 74.522,
   "text": "voice almost impossible\nto recognize.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 74.972,
   "e": 75.879,
   "text": "During those rituals,",
   "hl": [
    "Lucifer",
    "Judas"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 75.999,
   "e": 78.753,
   "text": "she sometimes called herself\nLucifer, and sometimes Judas.",
   "hl": [
    "Lucifer",
    "Judas"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 79.203,
   "e": 80.748,
   "text": "Anneliese died\nat the age of 23",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 80.868,
   "e": 82.689,
   "text": "from malnutrition\nand dehydration.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 83.139,
   "e": 85.352,
   "text": "By then, she weighed\nonly about 68 pounds.",
   "hl": [
    "68 pounds"
   ]
  },
  {
   "s": 85.802,
   "e": 88.377,
   "text": "Her parents and the two priests\nsat at the defendants' table.",
   "hl": []
  },
  {
   "s": 88.827,
   "e": 91.309,
   "text": "All four were later convicted\nof negligent homicide.",
   "hl": []
  }
 ],
